### Risks and Open Questions
*   **Brand Dilution:** Operating multiple product lines (decor, student projects, software) under one master brand can lead to confusion as the portfolio grows and may limit the ability to address distinct market segments effectively [12].
*   **Technical Performance:** The current site is hosted on Vercel; if the portfolio site is slower than the projects it showcases, it will lose credibility with technical business owners [10].
*   **Mobile Responsiveness:** There is a specific risk that the site has not been fully optimized for mobile viewing, which is a common issue with Vercel/AI-assisted builds [22].
*   **Single-Source Pricing:** The gross margin figures (60%+) and average order values ($70+) for lithophane lamps come from a single vendor source [3]. Real-world margins may vary based on local shipping costs and material prices.

